SUMMARY:The (Deeply Misunderstood) Evolutionary Science of Attraction
DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://luma.com/n3kog8wp\n\nAd
 dress:\nThe Foundry SF\nSan Francisco, CA\nUnited States\n\n💘 What if e
 verything evolutionary psychology told you about dating was wrong?\nFor de
 cades, a buzzy branch of science has spread a deeply flawed story about ro
 mantic relationships, cloaking itself in the language of incontrovertible 
 Darwinian fact. Evolutionary psychology claims our minds were shaped by pr
 imal drives that pit the genders against each other, from the myth that me
 n are wired to be promiscuous to the notion that wealth, status, and beaut
 y are the ultimate aphrodisiacs.\nIn this talk, UC Davis psychology profes
 sor Paul Eastwick, author of Bonded by Evolution and co-host of the…\n\n
 Hosted by Big Brain Bay Area
